  {
   "id": "overview",
   "title": "Overview",
   "type": "text",
   "paragraphs": [
    "Items, categories with GL classes, locations, lots and the movement ledger.",
    "Owned by <a href=\"/domains/inventory\">Inventory Control</a>. No other service writes to it; they ask its owner through /api/v1 or read posted events.",
    "Every table carries <code>created_at / created_by / updated_at / updated_by / version_no</code>; audit triggers copy each change into <code>audit_compliance.audit_event</code>, and version triggers increment <code>version_no</code> for optimistic locking."
   ]
  },
